Package: kiwiDecoder
Type: Package
Title: High-Throughput Barcode and QR-Code Decoding for Clonal Trials
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Kathy", "Ruggiero",
           email = "kathy.ruggioer@next.kiwi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for decoding barcodes and QR codes using the Python ZXing-CPP
    library, extracting diagnostic information, and integrating decoded symbols
    with biomaterial metadata from internal KiwiCloud sources. Includes helpers
    for batch processing, file renaming workflows, and visual diagnostics.
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.8), pillow (>= 10.0), zxingcpp; pillow-heif
    (optional, enables HEIC/HEIF image support)
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/KathyRuggiero/kiwiDecoder
BugReports: https://github.com/KathyRuggiero/kiwiDecoder/issues
